    "type": "question",
    "label": "16",
    "prompt": "Find the length of the space diagonal of a cube with side length $5\\text{ cm}$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$5\\sqrt3\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "Let $f$ be a face diagonal and $d$ the space diagonal, both measured in centimetres.\n$$\\begin{align*}f^2&=5^2+5^2\\\\f^2&=50\\\\d^2&=f^2+5^2\\\\d^2&=50+25\\\\d^2&=75\\\\d&=5\\sqrt3\\end{align*}$$\nThe space diagonal is $5\\sqrt3\\text{ cm}$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
